Package: PortalPalette
Type: Package
Title: Color Palettes Inspired by the Portal Video Games
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Neuromancer32",
           email = "neuromancer32@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Color palettes inspired by the Portal video games: a
    lightness-balanced orange-to-blue diverging palette, the original
    'classic' palette, sequential orange and blue palettes, and
    color-blind-checked categorical palettes based on the test chamber,
    overgrown and Rattmann den areas. Includes discrete and continuous color
    and fill scales for 'ggplot2' (with an optional midpoint for diverging
    data) and a matching minimal theme.
